# Verse — Roadmap

Tracked feature ideas for later. Items move here once we agree the direction
but haven't started building. When you start one, copy it into a real issue or
PR description.

## Deferred — pick up after current batch ships

### AI assistance in the editor
- Inline buttons in CreateQuoteModal: "Polish wording", "Suggest author",
  "Generate from mood".
- One shared `/api/ai/quote` route that takes `{ action, payload }` and routes
  to Claude Haiku for cheap, fast responses.
- Stream the response into the textarea so it feels live.
- Rate-limit per session.

### Format presets (Square, Portrait, Landscape, Pinterest)
- Make `QuoteCanvas` accept an aspect/preset prop instead of hardcoded 4:5.
- Presets:
  - `square`        1080 x 1080  (IG post)
  - `portrait`      1080 x 1350  (current default, IG / TikTok feed)
  - `story`         1080 x 1920  (IG / TikTok story)
  - `landscape`     1200 x 675   (Twitter / LinkedIn)
  - `pinterest`     1000 x 1500  (2:3)
- Persist preset on draft + quote rows.
- ExportButton exposes a preset switcher before download.

### Unsplash / Pexels background picker
- New "Search backgrounds" tab next to "Upload" in CreateQuoteModal.
- Server-side proxy to Unsplash API (keep key out of bundle).
- Grid of 12 thumbnails per page, infinite scroll.
- On select, store the full URL (Unsplash CDN is fine to hotlink with attribution).
- Required: show photographer credit on the canvas (small text) and in the
  share caption per Unsplash ToS.

### Remix / fork a quote
- "Remix" button on each QuoteCard footer.
- Opens CreateQuoteModal pre-filled with that quote's theme / alignment /
  background / authorCasing / showQuoteMarks — but blank text.
- Add `remixedFrom` column on `Quote` (nullable FK to parent quote id).
- Display "Remix of [original author]" badge on remixed quotes.

### Collections / boards
- Schema: `Collection { id, name, description, sessionId, isPublic, slug, createdAt }`
  + `CollectionQuote { collectionId, quoteId, order }`.
- "Save to collection" action on each quote.
- `/c/[slug]` public collection page.
- Profile view shows your public collections.
- Requires auth (or at least a stable session) to be useful long-term.

### Mood-based discovery
- Replace the rigid categories chip row with a "How are you feeling?" mood
  selector at the top of the feed.
- Moods: lost, hopeful, restless, grateful, defiant, in love, heartbroken,
  ambitious, tired, curious.
- Map each existing `QuoteCategory` to one or more moods (data migration), and
  let new quotes pick moods directly (multi-select).
- Mood pick stored in localStorage so the feed remembers.

## Backlog — quality / infra

### Moderation
- Profanity filter on publish (`bad-words` or similar).
- "Report" button on each quote -> `Report { id, quoteId, sessionId, reason, status }`.
- Reported quotes get `hidden = true` until reviewed.
- Simple `/admin` page gated by an env-var token to triage reports.

## Long-tail

### Random quote public API
- `GET /api/random` returning `{ id, text, author, category, url }`.
- Public, cacheable for 60s.
- Add docs page at `/api` so people can find it -> backlinks -> SEO.
- Optional: `?category=love` filter.
